rtunity to play for a storied club like Hamburger SV was too good to pass up,\\\" Noon said in an exclusive interview with our publication.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"\\\"I'm excited to bring my physicality and competitive spirit to the pitch and help the team succeed.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"Noon, who earned 38 caps for England between 2004 and 2009, has been out of the rugby spotlight since his retirement from the sport in 2012.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"However, it appears he's been keeping busy, secretly training with a local football club in his hometown of Birmingham.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"\\\"Hamburger SV is getting a top-notch athlete,\\\" said Noon's former England teammate, Mark Cueto.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"\\\"Colin's always been an exceptional player, and I have no doubt he'll make a seamless transition to football.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"He's got the size, strength, and agility to dominate on the pitch.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"Hamburger SV, currently sitting 12th in the Bundesliga table, is hoping Noon's arrival will provide a much-needed boost to their struggling campaign.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"The club's sporting director, Jens Todt, expressed his excitement about the signing, saying, \\\"Colin brings a unique set of skills to our team.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"His rugby background will undoubtedly add a new dimension to our game, and we're confident he'll become a fan favorite at the Volksparkstadion.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"Noon is expected to make his debut for Hamburger SV in their upcoming match against FC Union Berlin on March 17.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"When asked about the challenges of adapting to a new sport, Noon remained confident, citing his experience playing rugby sevens, a variant of the sport that shares some similarities with football.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"\\\"I'm not naive to the fact that there will be 